{"id":"628601","name":"白萝卜鸡蛋饼","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/628601/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"40克"},{"name":"葱","amount":"1段"},{"name":"干虾皮","amount":"10克"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"3勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白萝卜去皮擦丝。","img":"images/628601/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"擦丝后放入大碗中。","img":"images/628601/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入3克盐，拌匀。","img":"images/628601/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起油锅放入1勺食用油，放入虾皮翻炒，颜色变黄后出锅。","img":"images/628601/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"挤出水分，葱切碎和虾皮一起放入碗中。","img":"images/628601/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入面粉。","img":"images/628601/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入五香粉。","img":"images/628601/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入鸡蛋。","img":"images/628601/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"添加盐调味，拌匀即可。","img":"images/628601/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煎烤机刷油预热，将萝卜丝放入底盘。","img":"images/628601/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"上下盘同时加热，煎至两面金黄。","img":"images/628601/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"趁热食用。","img":"images/628601/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}